nt-size: 24px;\">Consideration</span></h2>\n<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Please hold the connector when plugging and unplugging, and do not forcefully twist the connectors to avoid wires loosening or detaching.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
